### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
# Paste a paymentId from the initiate response here
@paymentId = 3e7ca2af-0af2-4622-958e-244720616653
@orderId = ORD-20260601-001

### Process Payment (WeChat Pay)
# Processes the payment via the selected gateway. Requires a paymentId from the initiate step.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "{{paymentId}}",
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "gatewayName": "WECHAT_PAY",
  "params": {
    "openId": "oUpF8uMuAJO_M2pxb1Q9zNjWeS6o"
  }
}

### Process Payment (Alipay)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "{{paymentId}}",
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "gatewayName": "ALIPAY",
  "params": {
    "buyerId": "2088102177778888"
  }
}
